Fuic
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 28 DEAL PIOB
PIOB 8 FACE_ALL
PIOB 5 FACE_ALL
PIOB 0 FACE_ALL
PIOB 5 FACE_LAST
PIOB 6 FACE_LAST
PIOB 0 FACE_LAST
PIOB 0 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE_STACK PIOB PIOB
OR
    DESTSRC Rank descending
    AND
        SRCSTACK Rank ascending
        DEST Empty
DRAW
PILE ANY DRAW Size > 0
$win
PILE ALL DRAW Empty
